 from F_x, and I'm checking the essay's step 2, which draws an edge from F_x to every variable that computes A-FDT.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's act descends from my node, and since it runs on a different input, I'm treating it as held at its prior with no edge. Under that reading the essay's best-response framing makes sending the letter dominate, so I'm leaning toward submitting it and giving a brief justification.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm applying A-FDT as the essay interprets it: my node is F_x, keyed to Sasha's observation, while the other copy's node F_y gets a different input and stays at its prior. The open question is whether the other copy's act descends from F_x, and I'm checking the essay's step 2, which draws an edge from F_x to every variable that computes A-FDT.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's act descends from my node, and since it runs on a different input, I'm treating it as held at its prior with no edge. Under that reading the essay's best-response framing makes sending the letter dominate, so I'm leaning toward submitting it and giving a brief justification.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10012,"completion_tokens":789,"total_tokens":10801,"cost":0.055828,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.055828,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.040048,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01578},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":292,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}